{
    "title": "Meego - Video Call, Live Chat",
    "description": "Wanna have live video calls, meet people, make new friends and connect with the world with just a tap? Meego is the app you are looking for!\r\n\r\nMeego allows you to make friends with people from all over the world.  With video calling and translation, you can communicate with strangers like face to face anytime and anywhere. You can use it to meet new people, have fun conversations, and learn about different cultures. \r\n\r\nHere are some of the things you can do with Meego: \r\n\u2764\ufe0f One-on-one Video Chats with New Faces. You can video call anyone, anywhere in the world.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Make friends with people from all over the world. At Meego, you'll find cool friends to chat with no matter where you are.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Discover friends you may like via cover photo or short videos, and easily call them back.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Have fun conversations. You can use Meego to talk about anything you want, from your favorite hobbies to your deepest thoughts and feelings.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Communicate without barriers. Meego supports real-time translation, so you can chat with people who speak other languages. \r\n\u2764\ufe0f AI Beauty effects. Apply beauty effects for you automatically. It will surely make you more attractive and stylish in live video calls.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Have secure and private video chats. Meego uses end-to-end encryption to protect your privacy.\r\n\u2764\ufe0f Learn about different cultures. Meego is a great way to learn about different cultures and meet people from all walks of life. \r\n\r\nIf you're looking for a fun and easy way to make friends from all over the world, then Meego is the app for you. Download it now and start chatting! \r\n\r\nHere are some additional tips for using Meego: \r\n\u2764\ufe0f Be yourself. The best way to make friends is to be yourself. Don't try to be someone you're not, because people will be able to tell. \r\n\u2764\ufe0f Be respectful. Remember that you're talking to real people, so be respectful of their time and feelings. \r\n\u2764\ufe0f Be patient. It may take some time to find people you click with, but don't give up. Just keep chatting and eventually you'll find your people. \r\n\r\nHope you enjoy using Meego!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Wanna have live video calls, meet people, make new friends and connect with the world with just a tap? Meego is the app you are looking for!<br><br>Meego allows you to make friends with people from all over the world.  With video calling and translation, you can communicate with strangers like face to face anytime and anywhere. You can use it to meet new people, have fun conversations, and learn about different cultures. <br><br>Here are some of the things you can do with Meego: <br>\u2764\ufe0f One-on-one Video Chats with New Faces. You can video call anyone, anywhere in the world.<br>\u2764\ufe0f Make friends with people from all over the world. At Meego, you&#39;ll find cool friends to chat with no matter where you are.<br>\u2764\ufe0f Discover friends you may like via cover photo or short videos, and easily call them back.<br>\u2764\ufe0f Have fun conversations. You can use Meego to talk about anything you want, from your favorite hobbies to your deepest thoughts and feelings.<br>\u2764\ufe0f Communicate without barriers. Meego supports real-time translation, so you can chat with people who speak other languages. <br>\u2764\ufe0f AI Beauty effects. Apply beauty effects for you automatically. It will surely make you more attractive and stylish in live video calls.<br>\u2764\ufe0f Have secure and private video chats. Meego uses end-to-end encryption to protect your privacy.<br>\u2764\ufe0f Learn about different cultures. Meego is a great way to learn about different cultures and meet people from all walks of life. <br><br>If you&#39;re looking for a fun and easy way to make friends from all over the world, then Meego is the app for you. Download it now and start chatting! <br><br>Here are some additional tips for using Meego: <br>\u2764\ufe0f Be yourself. The best way to make friends is to be yourself. Don&#39;t try to be someone you&#39;re not, because people will be able to tell. <br>\u2764\ufe0f Be respectful. Remember that you&#39;re talking to real people, so be respectful of their time and feelings. <br>\u2764\ufe0f Be patient. It may take some time to find people you click with, but don&#39;t give up. Just keep chatting and eventually you&#39;ll find your people. <br><br>Hope you enjoy using Meego!",
